                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 37,
                            "last_played": 1444158118
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I like the setting, I did like the puzzles and I even like the graphics, but the advertised \"extensive randomization system\" is a total joke so there is actually no real reason for playing it again and 9.99€ for 20 minutes of gameplay is clearly overpriced. On top of that comes that it has been crashing for me three times before I could finish my first game (no save feature, so I had to restart every time).\n\nWithout the crashes (that seemingly not everybody has) I would recommend it for 4,99€ or less, but for 9,99€ I would have expected more randomization or a second map.",
